<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - UBS puts buy on Cambior.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - UBS puts buy on Cambior.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- UBS Securities said analyst Michale Dudas initiated coverage of Cambior Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- The stock was not immediately trading after closing Wednesday at 14-1/2 in the U.S.</p>
</text>
